videos.description:
The racing might not have gone ahead but that didn't stop the riders enjoying the track that the Hawkes Bay Mountain Bike Club had created for them.

@HBMTBShuttles run shuttles in the park so if you're ever in town they will get you up the hill.

#mtb #napier #downhillmtb

Unreal day with the boys @kylefindlay27, @mikaklabe and Muttz! This was my first time riding these trails in Vernon, BC, and what a sick day on the bikes! 🔥

We got to put the Cannondale Moterra 1 and Moterra LT to the test and see what they’re capable of, thanks to @valleymotosport 🤝

Definitely going to be back for more laps at Noble Canyon and Kalamalka Lake Provincial Park!

